# What the image never takes: secrets, local data, builds and dependencies made on this machine.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/*.pem
**/*.key
data/
docs/*
# The curriculum is the concept registry's source; the build copies it into the jar (pom.xml).
!docs/ICT_CONCEPTS.md
.git
.claude
